{"id":"ixzy7v91yfjfswl2dgghg7g0d","title":"为上下文感知的 AI 辩护","originalTitle":"Making the case for context-aware AI","summary":"Celonis 企业 AI 首席科学家 Devavrat Shah 主张企业 AI 必须获得业务运营上下文，才能实现他所说的\"决策智能\"。他建议把 AI 连接到企业现有流程与数据，用上下文层让 AI 智能体在既定护栏内工作，并从一个具体业务决策中最难的环节开始试点、衡量速度与价值增益后再扩展。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"MIT Technology Review · AI"},"links":{"original":"https://www.technologyreview.com/2026/10/22/1146812/making-the-case-for-context-aware-ai/"},"publishedAt":"2026-10-22T10:00:00.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-10-22T10:50:25.767Z","timelineAt":"2026-10-22T10:50:25.767Z","category":"opinion","tags":["大佬观点","Agent","部署/工程"],"score":28,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"e570fcc6-4e70-4774-9c95-87f1577151cb","title":"Celonis 科学家主张企业AI需接入业务上下文"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":"MIT Technology Review Insights","body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"e570fcc6-4e70-4774-9c95-87f1577151cb","title":"Celonis 科学家主张企业AI需接入业务上下文"}],"topics":[{"slug":"agent","name":"Agent 智能体"},{"slug":"engineering","name":"部署工程"},{"slug":"opinions","name":"大佬观点"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fH3Ghf7wZ4LM","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}